OL,3,GNEWSA90 at 90, the ride of a lifetime
OL,4,Ausing different modes of transport
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You've only got the one life, so live
OL,7,Fit."
OL,9,FDavid Laurillard has spent 90 weeks
OL,10,Ftravelling by 90 different modes of
OL,11,Ftransport.
OL,13,FThe 90-year-old, who lives in Andover,
OL,14,FHampshire, started the challenge aged
OL,15,F89 after contemplating his landmark
OL,16,Fbirthday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
