OL,3,GNEWSA90 at 90, the ride of a lifetime
OL,4,Ausing different modes of transport
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was lying in bed and thinking back
OL,7,Fon life. I've done a lot of travelling,
OL,8,FI've been very lucky. I knew I had a
OL,9,Fholiday booked when I'd be flying, and
OL,10,Falso a holiday when I'd be going on a
OL,11,Fboat," he explained.
